WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.835
What the hell happened? 

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.671
We were ambushed. 

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:06.006
They knew we were coming. 

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.480
We received a phone call
 about an emergency.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:14.280
Alba? 

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:16.516
Get down. 

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.918
We just need a place to
lay low for a little while. 

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:20.053
Are you having people over? 

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:20.620
-Yes.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.221
Cancel it. 

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:21.788
We can't. 

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:22.622
Phone lines are down. 

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:26.292
Welcome. 

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:27.727
She's beautiful. 

00:00:28.294 --> 00:00:30.864
I've never stolen
 anything in my entire life.

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.332
One of the bags is missing.

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:33.466
Where did you hide it?

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:34.901
Touch that gun so
I can blow your head off. 

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:35.802
Stop! 

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.373
I need someone to bring
me the diamonds. 

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:41.941
You're not among
friends here. 

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.779
We're not making it out
of this alive. 

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.685
Have faith there is
some way out of this. 

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.187
Getting emotional won’t help,

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:55.822
so don't get emotional.

